{"seq":2,"slug":"animal-nutrition-feed","title":"动物营养与饲料","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/animal-nutrition-feed","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nutrients-requirements","title":"大学动物科学 — 营养物质与需要量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/animal-nutrition-feed/nutrients-requirements","wordCount":1848,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"feed-ingredients","title":"大学动物科学 — 饲料原料与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/animal-nutrition-feed/feed-ingredients","wordCount":1707,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"diet-formulation","title":"大学动物科学 — 饲料配方与日粮设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/animal-nutrition-feed/diet-formulation","wordCount":1687,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"动物营养与饲料\">动物营养与饲料</h1><p>饲料成本通常占畜牧生产总成本的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%\\text{-}70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span>，因此&quot;喂什么、喂多少、怎么配&quot;几乎决定了一个养殖场的盈亏。本章先讲清楚动物到底需要哪几大类营养物质、它们各自承担什么生理任务，再介绍常见饲料原料的特点与价值，最后用数学方法把这些原料组合成一份既营养均衡又成本最低的日粮配方。</p>\n<p>营养学是动物科学中最&quot;接地气&quot;也最讲数字的部分。你将看到能量、蛋白质、矿物质和维生素如何被量化，如何用线性规划解出最省钱的配方。掌握这一章，你就握住了畜牧生产中最大的一个成本与效率杠杆。</p>\n"}